     "desc": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Send money to any উপায় (upay) number with only a few clicks. Now, you can send money easily through উপায় (upay) without any worry. Also, no need to worry about Cash Out charge, as you can add Cash Out charge while sending money to your friends and family.</span></div>",
